Recommends: dot-os-grub-theme (>= 0.1.0)
Description: DOT OS desktop on Debian and KDE Plasma
 Installs everything that makes up the DOT OS desktop: the Plasma global
 theme, widget, GTK and icon themes, cursors, fonts, terminal palette, boot
 splash and login screen, and the DOT OS package archive key.
 .
 Install it on Debian 13 to turn a Plasma desktop into DOT OS. New users get
 the DOT OS desktop at their first login.
